      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Acrobatics rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Acrobatics Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Resistances** poison  
      **Gear** light crossbow, shortsword, studded leather armor  
      **Senses** Passive Perception 16  
      **Languages** Common, Thieves' cant  
      **Challenge** 8 (3,900 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +3  

      ## Traits

      ***Evasion.*** If the assassin is subjected to an effect that allows it to make a Dexterity saving throw to take only half damage, the assassin instead takes no damage if it succeeds on the save and only half damage if it fails. It can't use this trait if it has the ***Incapacitated*** condition.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The assassin makes three attacks, using Shortsword or Light Crossbow in any combination.

      ***Shortsword.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=To Hit [Shortsword]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d6+4,dicelabel=Damage [Shortsword]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=5d6,dicelabel=Damage [Shortsword]) Poison damage, and the target has the ***Poisoned*** condition until the start of the assassin's next turn.

      ***Light Crossbow.*** *Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=To Hit [Light Crossbow]), range 80/320 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d8+4,dicelabel=Damage [Light Crossbow]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=6d6,dicelabel=Damage [Light Crossbow]) Poison damage.

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Cunning Action.*** The assassin takes the Dash, Disengage, or Hide action.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
